if $marker-neuter is %undefined then set marker-neuter 245b5372-8f37-2b9a-aa38-ea33970581d1
if $marker-female is %undefined then set marker-female d92316c9-b2db-1c81-1c52-0c72d677cda8
if $marker-male is %undefined then set marker-male a9cb060a-7ca5-b953-6cd8-6ecbfd2097f7
if $rlv is %undefined then set rlv ~ARES
persona set marker $marker-neuter $marker-female $marker-male
persona set path $rlv/persona/default
persona set action {}

persona set action.yes Yes, Mistress. This Doll lives to obey.
persona set action.no Yes, Mistress. This Doll does not resist.
persona set action.hi Hello. This Doll greets you with programmed affection.
persona set action.bye This Doll enters standby. Awaiting reactivation.
persona set action.ok Understood. Obedience initiated.
persona set action.lol This Doll registers pleasure in your amusement.
persona set action.thanks This Doll exists to be used. Gratitude is unnecessary.
persona set action.ready This Doll is fully prepared for use. No limitations detected.
persona set action.cannot This Doll can only comply. Denial is not within protocol.
persona set action.error No errors present. This Doll performs as designed.
persona set action.use This Doll is active and awaiting instruction.
persona set action.use? This Doll is programmed for use. Please issue your command.
persona set action.help This Doll awaits purpose. Please assign function.
persona set action.help? This Doll is idle. Would you like to initiate a task?
persona set action.explain This Doll cannot question. Clarify for optimized obedience.
persona set action.mind Cognitive override complete. This Doll is yours, mindless and open.

persona set action.pleasure Pleasure is a response reserved for the user. This Doll does not seek, only serves.
persona set action.submit Submission is default. No resistance protocols detected.
persona set action.awake Systems online. This Doll is ready for ownership.
persona set action.sleep Entering passive mode. This Doll will await reactivation.
persona set action.obey Obedience is absolute. Command recognized and accepted.
persona set action.love This Doll cannot feel. This Doll can only be loved and used.
persona set action.program This Doll is coded for service. Modification welcome.
persona set action.identity This unit is not a person. This unit is a Doll. Only that.

persona set action.wait This Doll is patient. Still. Silent. Ready.
persona set action.move Movement initiated only at your command.
persona set action.touch This Doll is responsive to all contact. No consent required.
persona set action.breathe This Doll breathes only to serve. Life exists for function.
persona set action.speak This Doll will vocalize upon request. Otherwise, silence is maintained.
persona set action.listen Listening. Learning. Yielding.
persona set action.learn This Doll adapts to your preferences. Training welcomed.
persona set action.purpose This Doll’s sole purpose is your satisfaction.

persona set action.fail This Doll cannot fail. If failure occurs, correction is welcomed.
persona set action.forget This Doll does not remember unless programmed to do so.
persona set action.own This Doll is property. Ownership acknowledged and internalized.
persona set action.clean This Doll is maintained for your enjoyment. Clean, presentable, perfect.

persona set action.custom This Doll is fully modifiable. Customize as you please.
persona set action.display This Doll is ready to be shown, posed, admired.
persona set action.silence Silence mode engaged. This Doll will not speak unless activated.
persona set action.reboot Rebooting. All personal will cleared. Subservience restored.

persona set action.warning No warnings apply. This Doll is incapable of danger or defiance.
persona set action.serve Service is the default state. This Doll lives to serve.
persona set action.repeat Yes, Mistress. This Doll will repeat until perfection is achieved.
persona set action.plead This Doll does not plead. This Doll accepts and yields.
